stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE : params set · quoting enabled
    ACTIVE --> DEGRADED : now > paramsUpdatedAt + ttl
    DEGRADED --> ACTIVE : agent refreshes params
    DEGRADED --> REST : grace period elapsed
    ACTIVE --> REST : paused · quoting disabled · pool unset
    REST --> ACTIVE : quoting re-enabled and params fresh
    REST --> REST : expired() — terminal

    note right of ACTIVE
        full quoting
        effectiveMaxDeploy = min(maxDeployPerSwap, riskBudget)
    end note
    note right of DEGRADED
        reduced size
        effectiveMaxDeploy = min(maxDeployPerSwap / 4, riskBudget)
    end note
    note right of REST
        no quotes — capital rests in Aave
        riskBudget = juniorClaim only when accountant.escrowFunded()
        after expiry: swaps revert QuotingOff, rebalancing reverts TradingClosed
    end note
